From 9ad0eabed249fdfd61310cba0ff99fdabc006880 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lcy <luochengyu@huawei.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:39:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(npu): add rq uniform quant for kv cache

Port RqUniform KV cache path onto motor-base (tag + existing Motor
patches). Synced from lcydev-v0.26.0rc1-rq-uniform @ 1e0613696. Ascend-only
rq_*_uq dtypes plus upstream turboquant_4bit_nc for SFA fused slots.
Exclude tools/docs from Motor export.

Signed-off-by: lcy <luochengyu@huawei.com>
