+# CacheDType Literal commits.
+#
+# Public Ascend names:
+#   rq_k8v4_uq  — Full-Attn / hybrid RqUniform K8V4
+#   rq_4bit_uq  — Full-Attn / hybrid RqUniform K4V4, or SFA rq_uniform 4bit_uq 388
